-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §45: an existing teacher of §7(ט)(2) who was
-- under the reform from his first day in the civil service is converted on
-- the status and the salary he would have had had he been taken on off the
-- reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `45 המרה למורה קיים שלא הועסק בשירות המדינה ערב המעבר שלו לרפורמה`

@ref akn:art_45
GIVEN `existing under 7(ט)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN, `under the reform from the first day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `converted on the pay he would have had off the reform` `existing under 7(ט)(2)` `under the reform from the first day` IF
    `existing under 7(ט)(2)` AND `under the reform from the first day`

#ASSERT `converted on the pay he would have had off the reform` TRUE TRUE
